1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,300
I am Spirit, Opportunity's twin.

2
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:04,200
NASA sent us to Mars together.

3
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:07,700
Each of us landed in a different place in 2004,

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,400
searching for the story of ancient water on Mars.

5
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:12,900
My mission was supposed to last about three months,

6
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:15,400
but I went on for more than six years.

7
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,600
Even when one of my wheels failed,

8
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:20,300
dragging it uncovered soil containing silica.

9
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:24,300
That helped scientists understand this place may once have had hot springs.

10
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:25,900
In 2009,

11
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:28,700
I got stuck in soft soil and couldn't get out.

12
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:30,300
They tried to help me for months.

13
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:33,300
But my last signal reached Earth in 2010.

14
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:35,000
My wheels may have stopped,

15
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:37,200
but what I discovered is still being told.

16
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:39,400
And that is the story I hope you remember me by.
